{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwvDBa3R1M4dNKM8wZWQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The difference-in-differences estimate is the `poa:jul` interaction coefficient from an OLS regression of `deposits` on `poa * jul`. It comes to about 6.52 Reais per customer.\n\nIn this model, `poa` is the Porto Alegre indicator and `jul` is the post-intervention (July) indicator. The interaction is the extra change in Porto Alegre from May to July, over and above the change seen in the control city, Florianopolis. In Florianopolis, deposits rose by about 34.52 Reais between May and July. Porto Alegre's rise was 6.52 Reais larger than that.\n\nANSWER: 6.52"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":166,"cache_read_input_tokens":30544,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":166},"output_tokens":212,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c3954008-92dc-426a-9ceb-7c4ecdd6e4d9","uuid":"7919f9c5-dd09-4423-bbce-4f662df64fa4","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:19:46.675Z","request_id":"req_011CgwvDBJvHkrVuUzWt1ALX"}
